[{"id":177576905,"discussion_id":"d34349079ba0e8c2954a2e0d798ba46eb0d70922","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| math/log_add_exp | ✅ [*唐燕峰*](https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7), [*冯彤*](https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng) (2/2) | ✅ [*唐燕峰*](https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n gcw_SUaZx3UQ, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-29T09:49:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T20:43:45+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177577319,"discussion_id":"34579214f94d7e7952c6b3730e0ebf6e31f94d72","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-29T09:51:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T09:51:44+08:00","user":{"id":"6842af273692723d6caa2469","login":"gcw_SUaZx3UQ","object_id":"6842af273692723d6caa2469","name":"zhangqijia1","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_SUaZx3UQ"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177577345,"discussion_id":"5eefb281d2956aa32473bdd749a40c147e971257","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本 PR 主要修复 `log_add_exp` 算子在处理极小输入值时，因 `log(1+exp(-|x|))` 中 `1+exp(-|x|)` 舍入误差导致精度丢失的问题。在算子核层面，引入 `StableLog1p` 模板结构体，以数值稳定的方式计算 `log1p(x)`，替换了原直接使用 `Vec::Log<Vec::Adds<..., 1>>` 的模式；在 API 层面，重构了存储格式检查逻辑，将原 `CheckFormat` 拆分为对 RegBase 场景的严格格式校验 (`CheckFormat`) 和非 RegBase 场景的警告 (`WarnFormat`)，并增加了对 `out` 张量格式一致性的校验。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `StableLog1p` 稳定计算模板**：在 `log_add_exp_dag.h` 中新增 `StableLog1p<CT, In>` 模板结构体，通过 `log(1+x) * x / ((1+x)-1)` 公式避免 `x` 极小时 `1+x` 被舍入为 `1` 导致结果为 0 的精度问题，同时处理了 `1+x` 为无穷大的边界情况。\n- **替换四组计算结构体中的 `log(1+x)` 实现**：将 `LogAddExpSimplifiedCompute`、`LogAddExpSimplifiedWithCastCompute`、`LogAddExpFullCompute` 和 `LogAddExpFullWithCastCompute` 中的 `ConstOne + Adds + Log` 三段式替换为 `StableLog1p<T, OpExp>::OpOut`。\n- **新增 `CMP_NE_MODE` 常量**：在算子常量区域添加 `CMP_NE_MODE = 5`，对应 `AscendC::CMPMODE::NE`，供 `StableLog1p` 中的数值掩码判断使用。\n- **重构 API 层格式检查逻辑**：将原 `CheckFormat(self, target)` 改为 `WarnFormat`（仅输出警告），新增带返回值的 `CheckFormat(self, other, out)` —— 校验 `self`/`other` 与 `out` 的存储格式一致性及是否属于私有格式，并在 `CheckParams` 中对 RegBase 场景强制执行该校验。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T09:51:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T09:51:51+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177577768,"discussion_id":"3e9f63cd5ee1f633c9c68a4e34c052d0c5ab8828","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4a243b02d4dd4e5dad9d292c8ac8560e&pipelineRunId=1ae22bff6a724457b183b758af46bb74&projectName=CANN'>1ae22bff6a724457b183b758af46bb74</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/d